{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_11_level_main_11-02_end","groupId":"main_11","stageId":"main_11-02","title":"一絲光亮","storyCode":"11-2","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_11-02_end.txt","sourceHash":"04b116301f6fbbfc9adf706385e70dca6bed001f3788493648dd8ca3e47766ff","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"一夜過後，薩卡茲大軍進入倫蒂尼姆。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g3_school_indoor"},{"type":"narration","text":"數小時後"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉爾夫——拉爾夫跑到哪裡去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真要命啊，這都亂成一團了，他怎麼還到處亂跑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天真的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"茉莉姐姐，拉爾夫說，他還從來沒見過大人們嘴裡的火炮是什麼樣子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"糟了，他不會是衝到街上去了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外面早就打起來了，到處都是飛來飛去的弩箭和榴彈——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去找他。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戈爾丁女士，這太危險了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g1_lentiavenue"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉爾夫！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"頑皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你快過來——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"頑皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嗚，戈爾丁女士......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別怕，好孩子，老師就在這裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"頑皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們回去——回去就好了，會沒事的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g3_school_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戈爾丁女士，拉爾夫！你們回來了，太好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"頑皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，茉莉姐姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉爾夫，你差點嚇死我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有孩子是不是都在這裡了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，女士，我都數過了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛、剛才那是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......有炮彈落到了附近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會這樣？到底是誰跟誰在交戰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不明白，上午還好好的，倫蒂尼姆怎麼就突然變成這樣子了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別哭，茉莉，別在孩子們面前哭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"握住我的手。至少我們都在一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們......我們有城防軍，還有蒸汽騎士呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們會保護倫蒂尼姆，保護維多利亞的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"頑皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"蒸汽騎士......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"頑皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"我剛剛好像看到了！是不是黑黑的，高高的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天真的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是路燈的影子吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"頑皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"胡說！那一定是蒸汽騎士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"頑皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"鞋匠湯姆總是念叨著他們，說他們就是維多利亞偉大的象徵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"頑皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"“踏過山谷，踏過河流，轟隆隆，轟隆隆，是什麼在響？不是打雷，不是颳風，是偉大的騎士，是偉大的維多利亞！”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這首歌我小時候也聽過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"教我唱歌的老師說，每年國王生日的時候，他們都會擠到廣場上，就為了看蒸汽騎士掠過整個方陣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"頑皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"蒸汽騎士是不是真的會飛呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老師說他們只是移動得太快，比落雷和疾風都要快，加上噴出來的蒸汽，看起來就像踩在雲朵上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"頑皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"太可惜啦，現在我們都沒有國王陛下了，我還從來沒見過閱兵式呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老師還說，老師的老師見過更厲害的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那一年維多利亞剛剛戰勝了高盧，為了給當時的陛下慶祝誕辰，幾十名蒸汽騎士全部回到了倫蒂尼姆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"甲胄們身披維多利亞的旗幟，當他們齊步從聖王會西部大堂的台階上走下來的時候，就像有一面巨大的旗幟鋪展開來一樣——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後所有人都聽到了比雷聲更響亮的吼叫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"頑皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"吼叫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，吼叫。在場的人都說，那是我們的旗幟上，維多利亞的象徵活了過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為自那一天起，維多利亞正式超越高盧，成為泰拉大地上最偉大的國家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，戈爾丁女士，我忘啦，您的祖父來自高盧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用同我道歉，茉莉。我和你，拉爾夫，還有曾經在這裡長大的千百個孩子一樣......都在倫蒂尼姆長大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說不定外面那具蒸汽甲胄裡的人也一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"頑皮的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"戈爾丁老師，您認識蒸汽騎士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......查爾斯·林奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他在奧克特里格區生活過。鞋匠湯姆是他的老朋友，所以才總是喜歡念叨陛下與蒸汽騎士的故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"實際上，他是陛下生前選中的最後一名蒸汽騎士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也是至今為止最後一名蒸汽騎士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g1_lentiavenue"},{"type":"narration","text":"第二天"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好像什麼都沒變嘛......大公爵的軍隊都到哪裡去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就知道，如果蒸汽騎士出場，局勢一定會很快控制住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是沒想到會這麼快......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......茉莉，我們得想辦法去買些必需品回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還不知道接下來會發生什麼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兩位小姐，你們怎麼出來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"亞當斯先生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正好，對於那些孩子來說，知識同樣不可或缺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......特別是在眼下的情況裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"亞當斯先生，請你把昨天那幾本戲劇集給我吧，恐怕我還得再多要一些......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，這些童話，那幾本有關數學與物理的入門書，還有《家庭醫療手冊》，請幫我都包起來......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，那是什麼聲音？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"不遠處傳來整齊劃一的腳步聲。\n不同於倫蒂尼姆人曾在閱兵式上聽到過的那種，這些腳步聲更加沉重，也更加急切。\n聖王會西部大堂。碎片大廈。議會廣場。\n一陣又一陣，接連不斷，踏過奧克特里格區幾乎空無一人的街道，踏上倫蒂尼姆的中央，維多利亞的心臟。\n當腳步聲逼近這條最平凡的街道的時候，一部分躲在路旁的人終於看清了那支正在行進的軍隊——\n或者說，看清了士兵們的樣貌。\n那些形狀各異的角凝結著不祥的黑色，就連迅速變白的天光都沒有辦法將它們照亮。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......薩卡茲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們是薩卡茲的雇傭兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然是雇傭兵，他們很快就會離開這裡吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到那時候，倫蒂尼姆會變回老樣子，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戈爾丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_647_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
